4. Her favorite dessert of all time is crème brûlée. (Verbatim: "my favorite dessert of all time... creme brulee creme brulee creme brulee")

5. She particularly enjoys crème brûlée from 7-Eleven in Japan and will order it whenever available at restaurants. (Verbatim: "I ate so many creme brulee ice creams from from 7-eleven in japan... whenever there's creme brulee at a restaurant I will order it")

